{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは生駒ちゃんですヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日だーいすきなまえのんちゃんの舞台を観に行ってきたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/11/12/2047483/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/11/12/2047483/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台版  レーカン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天海 響ちゃんを演じてるまえのんちゃんがもう可愛くて可愛くて❤︎❤︎❤︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーカン！は初めて知ったのですが、クスッと笑ったりジーンと心が温かくなったり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/11/12/2047483/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く面白かったですヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まえのんちゃんの演技もコープスパーティー以来自分の目で見て、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"役柄は全然違うけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらも素敵だなぁ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と改めて好きになってにやにやしながらお家に帰りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/11/12/2047483/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、こうやって自分の身近に素晴らしい人がいる事に感謝しないとなと思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トキメキをありがとうまえのんちゃん❤︎❤︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも是非観に行ってみて下さいね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただでさえ可愛い女の子いっぱい出てて幸せなのに、めっちゃ面白い舞台だから〜ヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなお友達と積極的にお話ししようと思いました(＾∀＾)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}